  "title": "How Do Volcanoes Erupt? 🌋 Magma, Lava & Volcano Islands for Kids",
  "cover_text": "ERUPT!",
  "description": "Dig deep inside the Earth to find melted rock, watch a volcano erupt, and see how volcanoes build brand-new islands! Leo asks, big sister Mia explains, with a quiz at the end.\n\nWant the 60-second version? It's on our Shorts tab.\n\nThe CurioKids Club: curious answers to kids' big questions. Subscribe: https://www.youtube.com/@CurioKidsClub",
  "hashtags": [
